        "text": "However, if you're looking to make gains over the short term, technical analysis might be a more suitable analysis framework. Short term price movements can be more effectively explained via technical analysis. This is because traders make a call on whether an asset's price will increase or decrease based on previous price action and technical indicators. Short term trading relies mainly on trading charts and not on the asset's fundamental value. It's also important to understand that traders and investors don't just have to stick with one type of analysis. It's common for the two to be combined, especially among crypto traders and investors. Let's look at an example. Alice has conducted fundamental analysis on Ethereum and found that its planned future improvements are likely to significantly drive up demand for the network services over the next several years.",
